<title>CANADA: CWB details 1996/97 grain/oilseed yield forecasts.</title>
<headline>CWB details 1996/97 grain/oilseed yield forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Thursday issued yield forecasts on western Canada's six major grain and oilseed crops at an industry briefing here.</p>
<p>CROP     StatsCan  CWB  Weather Model* UGG (bu/ac)</p>
<p>s.wheat  34.5	33.4     32.3	 34.2</p>
<p>durum    30.1	30.0     30.3	 ----</p>
<p>oats     69.6	68.0     63.6	 71.2</p>
<p>barley   58.9	58.0     55.3	 60.6</p>
<p>rye	31.2	30.0     27.4	 30.7</p>
<p>flax     22.1	21.0     19.9	 21.3</p>
<p>canola   25.7	23.5     22.1	 24.2</p>
<p>CWB 1996 summer crop tour spring wheat mean avg: 36.6 bu/ac *CWB weather model to forecast yields in use since 1989. --CWB yield column lists mid-range between weather model and crop tour yield estimates.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
